    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "3. Learned counsel for the applicant has submitted that the applicant is an innocent person and has falsely been implicated in the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 832,
      "end": 976,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1973337084054947
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "It is further contended that the case, under which the Bilal vs State Of Up on 10 January, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/199709312/\n1 applicant has been arrested, is a case of firing on the police party.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 977,
      "end": 1199,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bilal vs State Of Up on 10 January, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/199709312/\n1 applicant",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1032,
          "end": 1139
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16738727688789368
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "According to learned counsel, all the family members of the applicant have been roped in the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1200,
      "end": 1306,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12753412127494812
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "It is further contended that four cases have been registered against the applicant in the year 2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1307,
      "end": 1407,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13572560250759125
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Lastly, it is contended that the applicant is languishing in jail since 09.07.2024.\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1408,
      "end": 1494,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "09.07.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1480,
          "end": 1490
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14696374535560608
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Learned AGA has vehemently opposed the prayer for bail and submitted that the applicant has a long criminal history of 35 cases including the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1495,
      "end": 1650,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18510301411151886
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "He contends that out of 35 cases, 13 cases are under the Cow Slaughter Act while Gangster Act has been imposed twice upon the applicant once in 2015 and again in the year 2020.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1651,
      "end": 1827,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Cow Slaughter Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
